menu "PUD device"

    config PUD_LVGL_DEMO
        bool "Run the original LVGL demo instead of the PUD device firmware"
        default n
        help
            Keeps the vendor demo (LovyanGFX + LVGL 9 demo selector) buildable
            as a known-good reference for the display/touch hardware.  Default
            is the PUD device firmware.

endmenu
